  1117                              <1> ; at the end (ST_MISC bit 2): what POST found (40:13, INT 15h AH=88h).
  1118                              <1> ; EMS: CMOS 36h (64 KB units, at most 35h, as setup keeps it). XMS is
  1119                              <1> ; the extended memory HIMEM.SYS will offer as XMS.
  1120                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
